<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CURIOSITY / 拍照识植物</view><view class="title">认识眼前的绿意</view><view class="muted">拍清叶片、花朵和整株，尽量只包含一种植物。</view><view class="upload" bindtap="choose"><image wx:if="{{image}}" src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:else><view class="flower">❀</view><view>拍照或从相册选择</view><view class="muted">一张照片，开始了解</view></view></view><button bindtap="choose" disabled="{{busy}}">{{image ? '重新选择照片' : '选择植物照片'}}</button><button class="primary" bindtap="identify" disabled="{{!image || busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{busy ? '正在识别…' : '同意并开始识别'}}</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice">识别候选可能出错，相似外观无法确认毒性。以下分数由服务商提供，不是安全概率。请核对物种；低分、未收录或名称不明确时，应视为风险未知。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="name"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted">模型分数 {{item.scoreText}}</text></view><view class="notice">{{item.status === 'ambiguous' ? '名称有歧义 · 尚未确认' : item.status === 'unknown' ? '未收录 · 风险未知' : '名称候选 · 请核对身份'}}<view>{{item.message}}</view></view><view wx:for="{{item.candidates}}" wx:for-item="candidate" wx:key="id"><view class="body">{{candidate.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{candidate.latin}} · {{candidate.rank}}</view><button data-id="{{candidate.id}}" bindtap="open">查看参考档案（不是鉴定结论） →</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{done &amp;&amp; !results.length}}" class="empty">未识别到可靠候选，请换一张清晰的植物照片。</view></view>
